<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tarifs & Pass Premium - PDFULTIME</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { 
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; 
      background-color: #0f172a; 
      color: #f8fafc; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
      padding: 2rem; 
      max-width: 900px; 
      margin: 0 auto; 
      text-align: center; 
    }
    h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    p.sub { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .pricing-grid { 
      display: flex; 
      gap: 1.5rem; 
      justify-content: center; 
      flex-wrap: wrap; 
    }
    .card { 
      background: #1e293b; 
      border: 1px solid #334155; 
      border-radius: 12px; 
      padding: 2rem; 
      width: 260px; 
      text-align: left; 
      display: flex; 
      flex-direction: column; 
      justify-content: space-between; 
    }
    .card.pop { 
      border-color: #38bdf8; 
      position: relative; 
    }
    .card h3 { color: #fff; margin-top: 0; }
    .price { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .btn { 
      display: inline-block; 
      background: #2563eb; 
      color: #fff; 
      padding: 0.75rem; 
      border-radius: 8px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      text-align: center; 
      font-weight: 600; 
      margin-top: 1.5rem; 
      transition: background 0.2s; 
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    .back { 
      display: inline-block; 
      margin-bottom: 2rem; 
      color: #fff; 
      background: #1e293b; 
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem; 
      border-radius: 8px; 
      border: 1px solid #334155; 
      text-decoration: none; 
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/" class="back">← Retour à l'accueil</a>
  <h1>Passez à la vitesse supérieure</h1>
  <p class="sub">Accès illimité à tous les outils de conversion et de compression, sans abonnement.</p>

  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>Pass 24h</h3>
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem;">Idéal pour un dossier urgent.</p>
        <div class="price">2,99 €</div>
      </div>
      <a href="TON_LIEN_STRIPE_24H" class="btn">Choisir ce Pass</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card pop">
      <div>
        <span style="background: #38bdf8; color: #0f172a; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase;">Le plus populaire</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 1rem;">Pass 1 Semaine</h3>
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem;">Pour les examens et projets courts.</p>
        <div class="price">4,99 €</div>
      </div>
      <a href="TON_LIEN_STRIPE_SEMAINE" class="btn">Choisir ce Pass</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div>
        <h3>Pass 1 Mois</h3>
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem;">Pour les pros et gros volumes.</p>
        <div class="price">9,99 €</div>
      </div>
      <a href="TON_LIEN_STRIPE_MOIS" class="btn">Choisir ce Pass</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
